        "Content": "Set in a quiet cul-de-sac within the ever-popular Kilcross development, this superbly extended four-bedroom end-of-terrace home offers spacious and light-filled accommodation ideal for modern family living. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property combines stylish interiors with generous living space in a highly sought-after Sandyford location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room, and a beautifully extended open-plan kitchen/dining/family area to the rear with ample natural light and direct access to the garden — perfect for everyday living and entertaining alike. There is an office/ bedroom and utility area with w.c Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOccupying an enviable end-of-terrace position, the property benefits from additional side access, enhanced privacy, and a generous rear garden ideal for outdoor dining and family use. Residents of Kilcross enjoy a peaceful residential setting while remaining within easy reach of excellent local amenities including schools, shops, parks, Sandyford Business District, Dundrum Town Centre, and excellent transport links including the Luas and M50.\r\n\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in one of South Dublin’s most convenient and desirable neighbourhoods."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extended to the rear and side\r\nOff Street Parking\r\nSouth facing rear garden\r\nDouble glazed throughout\r\nG.F.C.H \r\nQuiet cul de sac"
      },
